# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim).
# Played by audio/jingles.js: game/loot.js, a Fabled weapon or better landing.
title    Legendary
composer Claude
about    Something rare falls: a glitter of crystal falling from very high, the bird's wide call ringing up high, wind chimes, a glass tap and a low singing bowl under it.
tempo    90
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.6

# mood explore: bird sweep harm bowl chimes tap

voice bird     crystal    vol=0.55 pan=0.3  rev=0.8
voice sweep    crystal    vol=0.26 pan=-0.3 rev=0.65
voice harm     glassharp  vol=0.22 pan=0    center=E5 att=0.15 rel=1.2
voice bowl     bowl       vol=0.4  pan=-0.1 rev=0.6
voice chimes   chimes     vol=0.4  pan=0.35
voice tap      glasstap   vol=0.3  pan=0.2

pattern rare
sweep   | E7 B6 A6 E6 B5 A5 .----- | _ |
bird    | .----- B7 E7+F#7---- | .----- E7 A6+B6---- |
harm    | [Esus2]?----------- | [Aadd9]----------- |
bowl    | A2----------- | _ |
chimes  | x..... ...... | x..x.. ...... |
tap     | ...... x..... | X..... ...... |

loop rare
